      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-298430",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/37/370dc204ed3448ba1a7feceec877e8d5542ea1d0048ba442884e23e3106b24b4.png)\n\nTwo households recorded the number of fruits each family member ate per day during a certain period. The information for Household A is summarized in the dot plot above, where each dot represents the number of fruits eaten by a certain household member on a particular day. For Household B, the most frequently reported number of servings eaten per day was $4$.\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe modal number of fruit servings eaten in Household A per day is\n{{field-1}}.\n\nThe mode for Household B is\n{{field-2}}\nthe mode for Household A.\n\nA comparison of the modes suggests\n{{field-3}}\nate more fruit servings per day."
