      ":question/problem": "![](images/99/990e62fced2156f74df53dd2ded1e148cbbff65ef055c38ed11285d4cab95c2e.png)\n\nTwo groups of students recorded the number of hours they studied over the weekend. The information for Group X is summarized in the histogram above. For Group Y, the most frequently reported number of hours studied was $4$.\n\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.\n\nThe mode of the number of study hours in Group X is\n{{field-1}}.\n\nThe mode for Group Y is\n{{field-2}}\nthe mode for Group X.\n\nA comparison of the modes suggests students in\n{{field-3}}\nstudied for longer."
